'''GirlsMons''' or '''Girls & Monsters: Angels of Terror''' (絶命美少女ギャルズモンスターズ, ''Zetsumei Bishōjo Gyaruzumonsutāzu'', '''Deadly Bishoujo: Girls Monsters''') is a [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Cat Capsule/Gacha]] event that was added in [[Version 6.0 Update|Version 6.0]] of [[Nyanko Daisensou]]. All [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare]] members of this set come from [[PONOS Corporation|PONOS]]' cancelled game [[GirlsMons]]. [[Version 9.5 Update|Version 9.5]] added a [[:Category:Legend Rare Cats|Legend Rare Cat]] from the defunct game [[Kyoutou Project]]. This set also introduced [[Multi-Hit|multi-hit]] attacks to [[Cat Units]], and it also seems to be the theme of this set, as all units have multi-hit.

