==Trivia==
*Because this set is technically a Collaboration, the Ubers do not appear in the [[UBERFEST (Gacha Event)|UBER]]/[[EPICFEST (Gacha Event)|EPIC]]/[[SUPERFEST (Gacha Event)|SUPERFEST]] or [[Platinum Capsules (Gacha Event)|Platinum]]/[[Legend Capsules (Gacha Event)|Legend Capsule]] banners.
**Despite this, Kyosaka Nanaho appeared in the [[100M DL Celebration (Removed Gacha Event)|100M DL Celebration Capsule]].
*Visually, the first 5 Ubers, Vega and Sidmi share a theme of obscuring their face to make them appear less conventionally attractive in their Normal Forms ([[Trickster Himeyuri (Uber Rare Cat)|Himeyuri]] has her Kitsune mask, [[Sea Maiden Ruri (Uber Rare Cat)|Ruri]] has a pair of large swirly glasses, [[Queen Reika (Uber Rare Cat)|Reika]] has her face wrapped, [[Wolfchild Deale (Uber Rare Cat)|Deale]] wears her costume's head, [[Graveflower Verbena (Uber Rare Cat)|Verbena]]'s face is stitched up and hollow, [[Spectral Goth Vega (Uber Rare Cat)|Vega]]'s face is partially obscured by a rose and [[Sorceress Sidmi (Uber Rare Cat)|Sidmi]]'s face is covered by a skull) before revealing their faces in their Evolved Forms. [[Adventurer Kanna (Uber Rare Cat)|Kanna]] and [[Ninja Girl Tomoe (Uber Rare Cat)|Tomoe]] do not follow this trend, however, having their faces shown in all forms.
*Despite [[Queen Reika (Uber Rare Cat)|Queen Reika]]'s Evolved Form having being erroneously dubbed as "Pharoah Reika" in the game prior to [[Version 14.2 Update|Version 14.2]], it has always been named "Pharaoh Reika" in the gacha banner.
*Although [[Kyosaka Nanaho (Legend Rare Cat)|Kyosaka Nanaho]] is in this banner, she actually doesn't come from GirlsMons. She comes from another abandoned PONOS game called Kyoutou Project.
*[[Goddess of Light Sirius (Uber Rare Cat)|Goddess of Light Sirius]] originates from the GirlsMons game as well, but she is obtained through [[Colossus Busters (Gacha Event)|Colossus Busters]] instead of this Gacha. She can also be dropped from the Platinum and Legend Capsules, unlike any of the units from this set.
*In the files for [[The Battle Cats Unite!]], it seems that this banner as well as the [[Nature's Guardians ELEMENTAL PIXIES (Gacha Event)|Nature's Guardians ELEMENTAL PIXIES]] will be planned additions, however, this could have been scrapped idea.

